{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misocheckboxpicker"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents18MISOCheckboxPickerV","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"MISOCheckboxPicker","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several checkboxes and select some of them within the others."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each checkbox contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose the choosen values using this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/init(selections:checkboxes:placement:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOCheckboxPicker"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a chekcbox trait."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPickerData","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition the root item of the picker has for accessiiblity identifier the displayed text."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Forbidden by design","level":2,"anchor":"Forbidden-by-design"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a read only state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both a read only and a disabled state."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in checkboxes using MISOCheckboxPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the MISOCheckboxItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional with default values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>] {","        [","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                       label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                       description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                       label: \"IPA beer\",","                                       description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                       label: \"Mineral water\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\"))","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [String] = [\"Choice_1\"] \/\/ or empty if nothing selected","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical by default","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections, checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can be vertical and have a root item with a label and a counter","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       placement: .verticalRooted(label, .textAndCount))","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horizontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the the checkboxes are in read only mode and use reversed layout.","    \/\/ Here the picker is horizontal and shows the scroll indicator","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","                       isReversed: true,","                       isReadOnly: true,","                       placement: .horizontal(true))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.14.0","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Since"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relations